      "body": "使用官方提供的 ArkTS、ArkUI、ArkData、ArkWeb、NetworkKit 等技术栈开发的 HarmonyOS  NEXT 原生 APP，已上架华为应用市场。\n\nGitHub 仓库：\n\nhttps://github.com/hefengbao/jingmo-for-HarmonyOS\n\n功能：\n\n1. 功能模块：经典诗文、诗文名句、汉字、词语、成语、对联、句子、知识卡片、节日、节气、传统色、世界遗产名录。\n2.  数据离线\n\n另附 Android 版仓库：\n\nhttps://github.com/hefengbao/jingmo\n\n截图：\n\n<img width=\"1080\" height=\"1920\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4bbf139c-2fd8-4418-87fe-0171fab7e954\" />\n\n<img width=\"720\" height=\"1280\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5b191c97-90d3-49d5-b4a1-12d084212d4e\" />\n\n<img width=\"720\" height=\"1280\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/633a8781-51b0-4e1f-b2b6-fddcfd968ffa\" />\n\n<img width=\"720\" height=\"1280\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2c9b4a25-8f2c-495b-a0f6-3af3b8ed244c\" />\n\n<img width=\"720\" height=\"1280\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3df3da68-8661-4456-b039-7250297d7605\" />\n\n<img width=\"720\" height=\"1280\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6c658b51-ca9c-4209-a648-42c3dc53da32\" />\n\n<img width=\"720\" height=\"1280\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f418314b-b700-4051-94c0-a2c5f08710e1\" />\n",
